-- 2026.10.02 - V6.2.0

- feat: Add an optional Panorama panel. `!k4`, `!rank`, `!missions`, `!top`, `!ranks`, and `!stats` open a clickable panel with Rank, Missions, Top, Ranks, and Stats tabs instead of chat lines
- feat: Show promotions, demotions, finished missions, and the daily streak bonus as toast pop-ups when the panel is on
- feat: Swap a daily mission with a button on the Missions tab
- feat: The panel looks like CS2's own UI: the scoreboard frame, main-menu tabs, CS2's rank icons, stat and weapon icons, laurels for the top three, and the game's own UI sounds. It uses only images that ship with CS2
- fix: SQLite storage works on Linux servers again. CS2 runs inside Valve's Steam Runtime (glibc 2.31), and the bundled SQLite library needed glibc 2.34, so K4 could not open its database there
- fix: The panel no longer gets rejected by CS2. Server-driven HUD layouts may only use Panel, Label, and Button elements with id, class, and text; the panel's icons are now drawn by the stylesheet
- fix: Join and leave announcements no longer fail; a failed leave announcement no longer skips saving the player, and leave messages no longer need the admin-list module
- fix: A drawn round no longer costs everyone the round-loss points, and admin point grants no longer show up in the round summary
- fix: Team balance moves players without killing them (no suicide penalty)
- fix: A rank reached through a permission mid-session now pays its reward
- fix: Missions: the day can no longer step backwards (daylight-saving zones), match missions need at least half the match played, held keys no longer count as active playtime, loading keeps retrying, and timezone offsets beyond ±14 hours fall back to UTC instead of stopping the plugin
- fix: Old mission days are purged even when `purge-after-days` is 0
- fix: Saving: one bad row no longer blocks everyone's saves, the final save on unload is always attempted, failed saves retry on their own, and a hot reload waits for the previous instance's unfinished saves
- fix: The LevelRanks mirror no longer overwrites stats, points, or playtime with zeros when those modules are off
- fix: A delayed personal-reset save no longer deletes rewards claimed after the reset
- fix: Points set through the shared API from another thread are applied on the game thread
- fix: Panel: a reopened panel is no longer closed by an earlier timer, the Top tab cannot page past the end, and the Missions tab refreshes after a completion or reroll
- fix: Unknown rank or admin-list colors are reported and replaced with the default color instead of being printed as words; weapon missions with unknown weapon names are reported
- config: The default top-placement tag is now `TOP #{placement}` (for example `TOP #3`); existing configs keep their own format
- feat: `css_k4_hud` (server console) reports the panel entity and each player's panel state, for troubleshooting
- setup: The panel needs the K4 workshop addon on players' clients through MultiAddonManager; it is off until `panorama.enabled` is set. Without it everything stays in chat
- docs: Add `panorama/README.md` with the layout source and the compile, upload, and server setup steps
- i18n: Translate the panel texts into all 36 languages

-- 2026.10.01 - V6.1.0

- feat: Add daily missions. Every day each player gets one easy, one medium, and one hard mission (150, 300, and 600 points by default)
- feat: Finishing all three missions on consecutive days builds a streak that adds 10% of the day's rewards per day, up to +70% on day 7
- feat: `!missions` shows a center-screen mission card and a chat list with progress bars; `!missions reroll <1-3>` swaps one unstarted mission per day
- feat: Missions cover kills, headshots, knife, grenade, no-scope, and weapon kills, assists, flash assists, MVPs, round wins, bomb plants and defuses, hostage rescues, playtime, and matches played or won
- feat: The mission list lives in `plugins/K4-System/missions.jsonc`; rewards, streak, rerolls, and the reset timezone are under `missions` in `k4-system.jsonc`
- feat: Missions reset at midnight in a configurable timezone (default Europe/Istanbul; offsets such as `+03:00` also work)
- feat: Keep missions fair: bot kills do not count by default (`missions.count-bots`), AFK minutes do not count, and round wins need the whole round on that team
- fix: Count match losses again when no human is left on the winning team
- db: Add the `k4missions` and `k4missionstate` tables; mission days older than two weeks are purged
